"that only the intended receiver can read the message.\\n"
"<p>"
"\\nThe selection of a certain encryption algorithm determines how easy or "
"how difficult it is to intercept and read a message. However, all algorithms "
"provided in the SPHINX environment are considered to be very safe. "
